art and professional industrial uniform appearance\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for factory and manufacturing employees\r\nâ€¢ Ideal for engineering workshops and maintenance teams\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for industrial staff uniforms and warehouse operations\r\nâ€¢ Reflective performance and safety certification not confirmed', 0.00, 0.00, 'Hide', 'Active', 0, '1792584353', ''),
