(99, 26, 36, 'Royal Blue Industrial Safety Jacket â€“ Reflective Stripe Workwear Jacket', 'royal-blue-industrial-safety-jacket-reflective-stripe-workwear-jacket', '', 'Royal Blue with Silver Grey Reflective-Style Stripes', '', 'assets/products/product_99/main.png', 'The Royal Blue Industrial Safety Jacket by Shivam Uniform features a vibrant royal blue design with contrasting silver grey reflective-style stripes on the shoulders and sleeves. Its professional workwear appearance makes it a suitable uniform choice for construction workers, factory employees, industrial technicians and maintenance teams.\r\n\r\nDesigned with a structured shirt-style collar, concealed front closure, two buttoned chest flap pockets and two lower flap pockets, this industrial jacket combines practical storage with a smart, coordinated appearance. The full-length sleeves feature silver grey reflective-style bands and buttoned cuffs, while the vertical shoulder detailing adds a distinctive high-visibility safety-inspired look. Ideal for construction sites, manufacturing facilities, engineering workshops and industrial workplaces, this jacket is suitable for businesses seeking professional industrial staff uniforms. Reflective performance and safety certification require manufacturer confirmation.', 'Royal Blue Industrial Safety Jacket â€“ Reflective Stripe Wo', 'The Royal Blue Industrial Safety Jacket by Shivam Uniform features a vibrant royal blue design with contrasting silver grey reflective-style stripes on the shou', '', '', 'Royal Blue Industrial Safety Jacket â€“ Reflective Stripe Wo', 'The Royal Blue Industrial Safety Jacket by Shivam Uniform features a vibrant royal blue design with contrasting silver grey reflective-style stripes on the shou', 'â€¢ Vibrant royal blue industrial jacket design\r\nâ€¢ Silver grey reflective-style vertical shoulder stripes\r\nâ€¢ Horizontal reflective-style bands on both sleeves\r\nâ€¢ Full-length sleeves with buttoned cuffs\r\nâ€¢ Structured shirt-st