(101, 26, 36, 'Charcoal Grey Industrial Safety Jacket â€“ Red and Silver Reflective Stripe Workwear Jacket', 'charcoal-grey-industrial-safety-jacket-red-and-silver-reflective-stripe-workwear-jacket', '', 'Charcoal Grey and Navy Blue with Red and Silver Grey Reflective-Style Stripes', '', 'assets/products/product_101/main.png', 'The Charcoal Grey Industrial Safety Jacket by Shivam Uniform features a distinctive charcoal grey design with navy blue contrast panels and bold red and silver grey reflective-style stripes. Its professional industrial appearance makes it a suitable uniform choice for factory workers, engineering technicians, automotive mechanics and maintenance teams.\r\n\r\nDesigned with a structured stand-up collar, concealed front closure and two contrasting navy blue flap-style chest pockets, this industrial jacket offers a smart workwear appearance. Multiple horizontal red and silver grey bands across the torso and sleeves create a striking safety-inspired design, while red shoulder piping adds a modern finishing touch. The full-length sleeves feature adjustable cuff tabs, making the jacket suitable for industrial staff uniforms, engineering workshops and manufacturing environments. Actual reflective performance and safety certification require manufacturer confirmation.', 'Charcoal Grey Industrial Safety Jacket â€“ Red and Silver Re', 'The Charcoal Grey Industrial Safety Jacket by Shivam Uniform features a distinctive charcoal grey design with navy blue contrast panels and bold red and silver', '', '', 'Charcoal Grey Industrial Safety Jacket â€“ Red and Silver Re', 'The Charcoal Grey Industrial Safety Jacket by Shivam Uniform features a distinctive charcoal grey design with navy blue contrast panels and bold red and silver', 'â€¢ Professional charcoal grey industrial jacket design\r\nâ€¢ Navy blue contrast panels on the chest, cuffs and lower sections\r\nâ€¢ Red and silver grey reflective-style horizontal stripes\r\nâ€¢ Multiple contrasting bands acros