(103, 27, 40, 'Grey Professional Chef Coat â€“ Black Contrast Collar and Buttoned Kitchen Jacket', 'grey-professional-chef-coat-black-contrast-collar-and-buttoned-kitchen-jacket', '', 'Grey with Black Contrast Detailing', '', 'assets/products/product_103/main.png', 'The Grey Professional Chef Coat by Shivam Uniform features a sophisticated grey design with contrasting black detailing for a smart and modern kitchen uniform appearance. Its asymmetrical button-front closure, mandarin-style collar and black contrast piping create a distinctive professional look suitable for chefs working in hotels, restaurants, cafes and commercial kitchens.\r\n\r\nDesigned with full-length sleeves, a practical chest pocket with black trim and an additional sleeve utility pocket, this chef coat combines classic culinary uniform styling with functional details. The black buttons and contrasting collar enhance its overall appearance, making it a suitable choice for executive chefs, sous chefs, culinary professionals and kitchen staff seeking a coordinated and polished uniform.', 'Grey Professional Chef Coat â€“ Black Contrast Collar and Bu', 'The Grey Professional Chef Coat by Shivam Uniform features a sophisticated grey design with contrasting black detailing for a smart and modern kitchen uniform a', '', '', 'Grey Professional Chef Coat â€“ Black Contrast Collar and Bu', 'The Grey Professional Chef Coat by Shivam Uniform features a sophisticated grey design with contrasting black detailing for a smart and modern kitchen uniform a', 'â€¢ Professional solid grey chef coat design\r\nâ€¢ Stylish black contrast collar detailing\r\nâ€¢ Asymmetrical front button closure\r\nâ€¢ Black buttons for a distinctive appearance\r\nâ€¢ Mandarin-style chef collar\r\nâ€¢ Black contrast piping along the front opening\r\nâ€¢ Full-length sleeves with black-trimmed cuffs\r\nâ€¢ Chest pocket with contrasting black trim\r\nâ€¢ Additional utility-style pocket on the upper sleeve\r\nâ€¢ Clean and modern professional kitchen uniform appearance\r\nâ€¢ Regular chef coat silhouette\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for hotel and restaurant chefs\r\nâ€¢ Ideal for executive chefs, sous chefs and culinary staff\r\nâ€¢ Complements professional hospitality uniforms', 0.00, 0.00, 'Hide', 'Active', 0, '1792585043', ''),
