s chefs\r\nâ€¢ Ideal for hotel and restaurant kitchen teams\r\nâ€¢ Appropriate for cafes, bakeries and catering services\r\nâ€¢ Complements professional hospitality uniforms', 0.00, 0.00, 'Hide', 'Active', 0, '1792585119', ''),
