(109, 30, 42, 'Sustainable polo Red  T-Shirt with White Contrast Piping', 'sustainable-polo-red-t-shirt-with-white-contrast-piping', '', 'Red with White Contrast Piping', '', 'assets/products/product_109/main.jpeg', 'Upgrade your team\'s professional appearance with the Red Sustainable Polo T-Shirt with White Contrast Piping from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a vibrant red colour, a classic polo collar, short sleeves and elegant white contrast detailing, this T-shirt offers a smart and modern uniform look.\r\n\r\nThe contrast piping along the collar and sleeve edges adds a stylish finishing touch, while the front button placket provides a traditional polo appearance. Ideal for Sustainable Polo employees, retail teams, promotional staff, hospitality professionals and branded company uniforms, this versatile polo T-shirt combines professional styling with everyday practicality.', 'Sustainable polo Red  T-Shirt with White Contrast Piping', 'Upgrade your team\'s professional appearance with the Red Sustainable Polo T-Shirt with White Contrast Piping from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a vibrant red colour', '', '', 'Sustainable polo Red  T-Shirt with White Contrast Piping', 'Upgrade your team\'s professional appearance with the Red Sustainable Polo T-Shirt with White Contrast Piping from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a vibrant red colour', 'â€¢ Vibrant red polo T-shirt design\r\nâ€¢ Elegant white contrast piping on collar\r\nâ€¢ White contrast detailing on sleeve edges\r\nâ€¢ Classic polo collar\r\nâ€¢ Front button placket\r\nâ€¢ Short sleeves\r\nâ€¢ Smart professional appearance\r\nâ€¢ Clean solid-colour design\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for Sustainable Polo and staff uniforms\r\nâ€¢ Ideal for retail and promotional teams\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for custom company logo branding, subject to availability\r\nâ€¢ Versatile styling for everyday professional wear', 0.00, 0.00, 'Hide', 'Active', 0, '1792649671', '1792650781'),
