(111, 30, 42, 'Light Grey Sustainable Polo T-Shirt with Black Contrast Piping', 'light-grey-sustainable-polo-t-shirt-with-black-contrast-piping', '', 'Light Grey with Black Contrast Piping', '', 'assets/products/product_111/main.jpeg', 'Upgrade your team\'s professional appearance with the Light Grey Sustainable Polo T-Shirt with Black Contrast Piping from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a sophisticated light grey colour, a classic polo collar, black contrast piping and stylish wood-textured buttons, this T-shirt offers a clean and modern Sustainable Polo look.\r\n\r\nThe short sleeves feature subtle black contrast detailing, while the front button placket adds a refined finishing touch. Ideal for Sustainable Polo employees, retail teams, showroom staff, hospitality professionals and promotional events, this polo T-shirt provides versatile styling for everyday professional wear.', 'Light Grey Sustainable Polo T-Shirt with Black Contrast Pipi', 'Upgrade your team\'s professional appearance with the Light Grey Sustainable Polo T-Shirt with Black Contrast Piping from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a sophisticat', '', '', 'Light Grey Sustainable Polo T-Shirt with Black Contrast Pipi', 'Upgrade your team\'s professional appearance with the Light Grey Sustainable Polo T-Shirt with Black Contrast Piping from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a sophisticat', 'â€¢ Elegant light grey polo T-shirt design\r\nâ€¢ Stylish black contrast piping on collar\r\nâ€¢ Black contrast detailing on sleeve edges\r\nâ€¢ Classic polo collar\r\nâ€¢ Wood-textured front buttons\r\nâ€¢ Short sleeves\r\nâ€¢ Smart and professional appearance\r\nâ€¢ Clean solid-colour design\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for Sustainable Polo and staff uniforms\r\nâ€¢ Ideal for retail and promotional teams\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for custom company logo branding, subject to availability\r\nâ€¢ Versatile everyday workwear styling', 0.00, 0.00, 'Hide', 'Active', 0, '1792650268', '1792650703'),
(112, 30, 42, 'Midnight Navy Sustainable Polo T-Shirt with White Contrast Piping', 'midnight-navy-sustainable-polo-t-shirt-with-white-contrast-piping', '', 'Midnight Navy with White Contrast Piping', '', 'assets/products/product_112/main.jpeg', 'Discover timeless styling with the Midnight Navy Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a rich midnight navy colour, elegant white contrast piping along the collar and sleeve edges, and a classic polo neckline, this T-shirt delivers a refined and versatile appearance.\r\n\r\nThe short-sleeve design, contrasting white button placket and clean finishing create a sophisticated look suitable for casual outings, smart casual dressing, team apparel and branded clothing. Its understated colour combination makes it a versatile addition to any wardrobe. Part of our Sustainable Polo collection, this design combines classic polo styling with modern appeal.', 'Midnight Navy Sustainable Polo T-Shirt with White Contrast P', 'Discover timeless styling with the Midnight Navy Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a rich midnight navy colour, elegant white contrast pip', '', '', 'Midnight Navy Sustainable Polo T-Shirt with White Contrast P', 'Discover timeless styling with the Midnight Navy Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a rich midnight navy colour, elegant white contrast pip', 'â€¢ Elegant midnight navy polo T-shirt design\r\nâ€¢ White contrast piping on the collar\r\nâ€¢ White detailing on sleeve edges\r\nâ€¢ Classic polo collar\r\nâ€¢ Contrasting white front button placket\r\nâ€¢ Short sleeves\r\nâ€¢ Clean and minimal solid-colour design\r\nâ€¢ Smart casual appearance\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for everyday and team wear\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for custom logo branding, subject to availability\r\nâ€¢ Part of the Sustainable Polo collection', 0.00, 0.00, 'Hide', 'Active', 0, '1792651984', ''),
(113, 30, 42, 'Sky Blue Sustainable Polo T-Shirt â€“ Classic Short Sleeve', 'sky-blue-sustainable-polo-t-shirt-classic-short-sleeve', '', 'Sky Blue', '', 'assets/products/product_113/main.jpeg', 'Refresh your everyday wardrobe with the Sky Blue Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a vibrant sky blue shade, a classic ribbed polo collar, short sleeves and a traditional front button placket, this T-shirt offers a clean, modern and versatile appearance.\r\n\r\nIts simple solid-colour design makes it suitable for casual outings, smart casual dressing, team apparel and custom branded clothing. The neatly finished sleeve edges and classic polo styling create a polished look that works across a variety of occasions. Part of the Sustainable Polo collection, this T-shirt brings timeless styling to everyday wear.', 'Sky Blue Sustainable Polo T-Shirt â€“ Classic Short Sleeve', 'Refresh your everyday wardrobe with the Sky Blue Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a vibrant sky blue shade, a classic ribbed polo collar,', '', '', 'Sky Blue Sustainable Polo T-Shirt â€“ Classic Short Sleeve', 'Refresh your everyday wardrobe with the Sky Blue Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a vibrant sky blue shade, a classic ribbed polo collar,', 'â€¢ Attractive sky blue solid-colour design\r\nâ€¢ Classic ribbed polo collar\r\nâ€¢ Front button placket\r\nâ€¢ Short sleeves with neatly finished cuffs\r\nâ€¢ Clean and minimal appearance\r\nâ€¢ Versatile smart casual styling\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for everyday and team wear\r\nâ€¢ Ideal for promotional and staff apparel\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for custom company logo branding, subject to availability\r\nâ€¢ Part of the Sustainable Polo collection', 0.00, 0.00, 'Hide', 'Active', 0, '1792652113', ''),
(114, 30, 42, 'Dark Forest Green Sustainable Polo T-Shirt â€“ Classic Short Sleeve', 'dark-forest-green-sustainable-polo-t-shirt-classic-short-sleeve', '', 'Dark Forest Green', '', 'assets/products/product_114/main.jpeg', 'Add a timeless touch to your wardrobe with the Dark Forest Green Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a rich forest green shade, a classic polo collar, short sleeves and a traditional front button placket, this T-shirt offers a clean, sophisticated and versatile look.\r\n\r\nThe minimal solid-colour design makes it suitable for everyday casual wear, smart casual outfits, team apparel and custom branded clothing. Its neatly finished sleeves and classic polo styling create a polished appearance for a variety of occasions. Part of the Sustainable Polo collection, this T-shirt combines understated styling with everyday versatility.', 'Dark Forest Green Sustainable Polo T-Shirt â€“ Classic Short', 'Add a timeless touch to your wardrobe with the Dark Forest Green Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a rich forest green shade, a classic po', '', '', 'Dark Forest Green Sustainable Polo T-Shirt â€“ Classic Short', 'Add a timeless touch to your wardrobe with the Dark Forest Green Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a rich forest green shade, a classic po', 'â€¢ Rich dark forest green colour\r\nâ€¢ Classic collared polo T-shirt design\r\nâ€¢ Front two-button placket\r\nâ€¢ Short sleeves with neatly finished cuffs\r\nâ€¢ Minimal solid-colour appearance\r\nâ€¢ Smart and versatile styling\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for casual and team wear\r\nâ€¢ Ideal for promotional and staff apparel\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for custom logo branding, subject to availability\r\nâ€¢ Part of the Sustainable Polo collection', 0.00, 0.00, 'Hide', 'Active', 0, '1792652233', ''),
(115, 30, 42, 'Sunrise Yellow Sustainable Polo T-Shirt â€“ Classic Short Sleeve', 'sunrise-yellow-sustainable-polo-t-shirt-classic-short-sleeve', '', 'Sunrise Yellow', '', 'assets/products/product_115/main.jpeg', 'Refresh your everyday wardrobe with the Sunrise Yellow Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a soft, refreshing yellow shade, a classic polo collar, short sleeves and a traditional front button placket, this T-shirt offers a clean and versatile appearance.\r\n\r\nThe minimal solid-colour design and neatly finished sleeve cuffs make it suitable for casual outings, smart casual styling, promotional events and team apparel. Part of the Sustainable Polo collection, this T-shirt brings together timeless polo styling and everyday versatility.', 'Sunrise Yellow Sustainable Polo T-Shirt â€“ Classic Short Sl', 'Refresh your everyday wardrobe with the Sunrise Yellow Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a soft, refreshing yellow shade, a classic polo c', '', '', 'Sunrise Yellow Sustainable Polo T-Shirt â€“ Classic Short Sl', 'Refresh your everyday wardrobe with the Sunrise Yellow Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a soft, refreshing yellow shade, a classic polo c', 'â€¢ Attractive Sunrise Yellow colour\r\nâ€¢ Classic collared polo T-shirt design\r\nâ€¢ Front button placket\r\nâ€¢ Short sleeves with ribbed cuffs\r\nâ€¢ Minimal solid-colour appearance\r\nâ€¢ Neatly finished collar and sleeves\r\nâ€¢ Smart and versatile styling\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for casual and team wear\r\nâ€¢ Ideal for promotional and staff apparel\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for custom logo branding, subject to availability\r\nâ€¢ Part of the Sustainable Polo collection', 0.00, 0.00, 'Hide', 'Active', 0, '1792652338', ''),
(116, 30, 42, 'Classic White Sustainable Polo T-Shirt â€“ Short Sleeve', 'classic-white-sustainable-polo-t-shirt-short-sleeve', '', 'White', '', 'assets/products/product_116/main.jpeg', 'Upgrade your everyday style with the Classic White Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a timeless white colour, a classic polo collar, short sleeves and a neat front button placket, this T-shirt offers a clean, versatile and professional appearance.\r\n\r\nThe minimalist solid-colour design makes it suitable for casual outings, team apparel, promotional events and staff uniforms. The refined collar, simple button detailing and neatly finished sleeves create a smart look that pairs easily with jeans, chinos or formal trousers. Part of the Sustainable Polo collection, this classic white polo is a versatile addition to any wardrobe.', 'Classic White Sustainable Polo T-Shirt â€“ Short Sleeve', 'Upgrade your everyday style with the Classic White Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a timeless white colour, a classic polo collar, short', '', '', 'Classic White Sustainable Polo T-Shirt â€“ Short Sleeve', 'Upgrade your everyday style with the Classic White Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Featuring a timeless white colour, a classic polo collar, short', 'â€¢ Classic solid white colour\r\nâ€¢ Traditional polo collar design\r\nâ€¢ Front button placket\r\nâ€¢ Short sleeves with neat finishing\r\nâ€¢ Clean and minimal appearance\r\nâ€¢ Versatile regular-fit styling\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for casual and professional wear\r\nâ€¢ Ideal for staff uniforms and team apparel\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for custom logo branding, subject to availability\r\nâ€¢ Part of the Sustainable Polo collection', 0.00, 0.00, 'Hide', 'Active', 0, '1792652965', ''),
(117, 30, 42, 'Classic Beige Sustainable Polo T-Shirt â€“ Short Sleeve', 'classic-beige-sustainable-polo-t-shirt-short-sleeve', '', 'Classic Beige', '', 'assets/products/product_117/main.jpeg', 'Discover timeless style with the Classic Beige Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Designed in an elegant neutral beige shade, this polo features a classic ribbed collar, short sleeves, a traditional button placket and distinctive wood-textured button detailing.\r\n\r\nIts minimal solid-colour appearance makes it a versatile choice for everyday wear, smart casual outfits, staff uniforms and team apparel. The neatly finished collar and ribbed sleeve cuffs add a refined touch, while the neutral colour pairs effortlessly with trousers, chinos or jeans. A stylish addition to the Sustainable Polo collection.', 'Classic Beige Sustainable Polo T-Shirt â€“ Short Sleeve', 'Discover timeless style with the Classic Beige Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Designed in an elegant neutral beige shade, this polo features a cl', '', '', 'Classic Beige Sustainable Polo T-Shirt â€“ Short Sleeve', 'Discover timeless style with the Classic Beige Sustainable Polo T-Shirt from Shivam Uniform. Designed in an elegant neutral beige shade, this polo features a cl', 'â€¢ Elegant classic beige colour\r\nâ€¢ Traditional ribbed polo collar\r\nâ€¢ Wood-textured button detailing\r\nâ€¢ Front button placket\r\nâ€¢ Short sleeves with ribbed cuffs\r\nâ€¢ Minimal solid-colour design\r\nâ€¢ Regular-fit styling\r\nâ€¢ Neatly finished seams and hem\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for casual and smart casual wear\r\nâ€¢ Ideal for staff uniforms and team apparel\r\nâ€¢ Suitable for custom logo branding, subject to availability\r\nâ€¢ Part of the Sustainable Polo collection', 0.00, 0.00, 'Hide', 'Active', 0, '1792653112', '');

